      "literal": "$$\nZ_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n= \\begin{cases}\n\\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[2mm]\n-\\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n,\n\\end{cases}\n$$",
