      "literal": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nG \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(3\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(3\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\nG^2 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(5\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(5\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\nG^3 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(7\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(7\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "status": "exact",
      "display": "1.  (G) (qketstate('u')) = cos(3 · 'θ') |A_0⟩ + sin(3 · 'θ') |A_1⟩\n\n2.  (G^2) (qketstate('u')) = cos(5 · 'θ') |A_0⟩ + sin(5 · 'θ') |A_1⟩\n\n3.  (G^3) (qketstate('u')) = cos(7 · 'θ') |A_0⟩ + sin(7 · 'θ') |A_1⟩",
      "copy": "\\begin{gathered}qcompare(qadjacent(G,qketstate('u')),qadd(qadjacent(qcos(qadjacent(3,'θ')),qnamedket(\"A_0\")),qadjacent(qsin(qadjacent(3,'θ')),qnamedket(\"A_1\"))),4)\\\\qcompare(qadjacent(qpower(G,2),qketstate('u')),qadd(qadjacent(qcos(qadjacent(5,'θ')),qnamedket(\"A_0\")),qadjacent(qsin(qadjacent(5,'θ')),qnamedket(\"A_1\"))),4)\\\\qcompare(qadjacent(qpower(G,3),qketstate('u')),qadd(qadjacent(qcos(qadjacent(7,'θ')),qnamedket(\"A_0\")),qadjacent(qsin(qadjacent(7,'θ')),qnamedket(\"A_1\"))),4)\\end{gathered}"
